{
  "description": "historyForLLM(messages, options). `options` is a patch over the defaults {maxMessages: 500, maxToolResultChars: 8000}; a value <= 0 means unlimited. Steps, in order: keep the last maxMessages; drop everything before the first user message unless there is none; cut to the first index from which every tool message has a preceding assistant declaring its toolCallId (findLegalStart); truncate each tool result longer than maxToolResultChars to ceil(n/2) head characters + \"\\n\\n… [<omitted> characters truncated] …\\n\\n\" + the remaining tail characters, setting truncated: true. Lengths are UTF-16 code units. Messages are the canonical ChatMessage shapes.",
